>>
endobj
258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (shopping experience by reducing billing time and avoiding long queues at checkout counters. The cart is equipped with an ESP32- CAM module, Arduino controller, and billing software. When a customer places an item in the cart, the ESP32- CAM captures the Barcode and identifies the item using barcode processing and programmed software.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E ( The product details such as name, price, and quantity are automatically added to the total bill in the system. If an item is removed, the bill updates instantly. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
