/P 186 0 R
/E (The Auto-Refresher \(setInterval\): The absolute most important line of code is at the very bottom: setInterval\(loadCart, 2000\);. This acts as a heartbeat. Every 2,000 milliseconds \(2 seconds\), it commands the browser to run the loadCart\(\) function. This means the screen updates automatically without the user ever having to hit the "Refresh" button.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
