808 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (By proving that these electronics can be attached to existing metal trolleys, we conclude that this technology is scalable and inclusive. Furthermore, the seamless integration of UPI via the ESP32 proved that India is uniquely positioned to lead this change. Because our digital payment infrastructure is already so advanced, the "Smart Cart" is the final missing piece of the puzzle to make our stores as advanced as our payment apps.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
809 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (From a technical standpoint, the project concludes that while the logic is solid, the physical environment is the biggest challenge. We learned that while jumper wires are great for the lab, the vibrations of a moving cart require a more permanent solution like a PCB or "hard-soldering.")
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [11]
>>
