/Title (6. Labor Reallocation The data does not interpret this as simply firing employees. Instead, it is interpreted as a massive Return on Investment \(ROI\) where human labor is reallocated. Employees are freed from acting "like robots" doing repetitive scanning and are moved onto the floor to help customers, making the store feel more human..)
