/Title (4. Macro-Level Store Intelligence \(Predictive Data\) The project interprets the cart not just as a billing tool, but as a moving data-collection node. Traditionally, a store only knows an item is sold after it passes the register. By interpreting the live cart data, the store gains predictive inventory intelligence. The manager knows the shelf will be empty before the stock actually runs out, allowing for proactive restocking and preventing "out of stock" disappointments for the next wave of customers.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1976 0 R
/Next 1968 0 R
>>
endobj
