/Title (3. Demographic Adoption and System Feedback The team gathered data on how different types of humans interact with the machine.  the learning curve is exceptionally flat; after just one "practice scan," any age group can master the system. Furthermore, interpreting the "accidental theft" data led to a crucial UI design choice: the system must correct human error quietly to maintain a "high-trust environment," rather than punishing the user with loud, embarrassing alarms.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1980 0 R
/Next 1972 0 R
